  "display_title": "The Wolf of the Full Moon",
  "description": "As the daughter of the premier of Joseon, Han Wolyeong had a happy life. That is, until her father's political enemies killed her clan and took her prisoner—enter Doheon, a mysterious god who saves her and confesses his love. Now, Wolyeong and Doheon are set to spend 30 nights of passion with each other to fulfill their destiny and get a wish from the heavens. But with Wolyeong's enemies still searching for her, is she truly safe? Or will her happiness be destroyed once more?\n\n(Source: Tapas)\n\n*Note: Part of Metatoon's Sunae(純愛) Danpyeonseon (순애(純愛) 단편선) Collection.*",
